sonora (0.3.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Level meters: inter-sample (true) peak detection with 192 kHz oversampling;
    the red over-0 dB LED lights for overs between samples and is held longer.
  * LED grid anchored at 0 dB for any LED step.

